    feat(bar-end-vikuiti): End-only readout + Vikuiti air-gap on all lateral faces
    
    Physics model:
      - Bar surface: dielectric_dielectric polished → TIR at θ > 39.3°
      - Air gap 0.10 mm + Vikuiti 3M ESR 0.05 mm on -Y, +Y, +Z, -Z faces
      - +Y panel added conditionally when NOT IsTopInstrumented (End mode)
      - End SiPMs ±X only (face_type=0 left, face_type=1 right)
    
    Additions vs feat/endtop-sslg4:
      - OPSC-106 (EJ-230) support with L=120 cm, rise=0.5 ns overrides
      - GROUPVEL = c/1.58 fix for world air (prevents superluminal aliasing)
      - +Y Vikuiti panel in End mode
      - Renamed Mylar volumes → Vikuiti; surface CreateBarSkinReflector R=0.98
    
    Validated (100 ev, x=0):
      EJ-204: 1896 ph/ev | EJ-230: 1361 ph/ev | EJ-200: 2651 ph/ev
      face_type=2 (top) = 0 for all — End readout confirmed
    
